WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.380
We're proudly exporting energy all over the world.

00:02.380 --> 00:04.600
We're now the largest exporter.

00:04.600 --> 00:07.800
In the United States, we want trade and robust commerce

00:07.800 --> 00:10.740
with all nations, everybody.

00:10.740 --> 00:11.940
We want to help nations.

00:11.940 --> 00:13.940
We're going to help nations.

